@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

:Editor: as Editor
(Add City) as (AddCity)
Editor --> (AddCity)

note right of Editor : The Editor can place\n a city on the selected map.

note right of (AddCity)
The city is added at the specified XY position
with a given name and a positive number
of house blocks.
end note

note right of (AddCity) #lightblue
The city name cannot contain
special characters or digits.
end note

note left of (AddCity) #lightgreen
House blocks can be assigned
manually or automatically (randomly
around the city tag position).
end note

@enduml
